WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.626 --> 00:00:01.543
Director:
Is this them?

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:02.961
Of course it's them!

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:05.714
Director:
The intrepid ranger who lives in
a castle in the park

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:07.883
Director:
with his indie journalist wife
and their two kids.

00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:10.135
Do you guys want to see where
we're shooting this scene?

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:12.554
-Ahhhh!
-I thought you said you were
gonna play it cool.

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:14.514
Right, right.
Aww.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.057
Better?

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:15.599
Weirder.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.600
♪♪

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:17.893
Owen: 
I got a big plan.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:19.853
Owen:
The more people see the park in
all of its beauty,

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:21.480
the more they’ll want to come!

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.522
Owen:
Who knows?

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.983
It might even get the attention
of the interim mayor.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:28.403
I mean it's pretty interesting.
It's like eating a burger, but
it's in a tube.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:29.529
You can't be serious.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:36.578
♪Now that winter has fled the 
scene we can roll up our
sleeves.♪

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:38.914
-You're here!
-I'm here!

00:00:38.914 --> 00:00:39.623
Abby:
I did it.

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:42.209
Abby:
I'm an actress living
in the Big Apple.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:43.293
What part are you auditioning
for?

00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:44.711
Customer number two.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.921
Give us your best bite and
smile.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:46.672
Here I go.

00:00:46.672 --> 00:00:47.422
(Chomp)

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:48.924
I mean this in the nicest
possible way.

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:51.468
You look like you sat
bare-cheeked on a grumpy
porcupine.

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:52.177
Right, right.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:59.351
♪Dig a little deeper,
sewing something better, tend
the  earth to make it last♪

00:00:59.351 --> 00:00:59.977
Look at it.

00:00:59.977 --> 00:01:02.229
The stupid park doesn't even
know whats coming.

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:03.355
How would a park know what's...

00:01:03.355 --> 00:01:04.648
Shush, I'm plotting.

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:05.857
(Screaming)

00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:09.027
-(Screaming)
-Uh. Yep. Good. Eh. Knock that
down.

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.487
And you just kicked a chicken.

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.321
 ♪♪

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:13.156
I love the idea of getting back
to basics.

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:13.949
♪♪

00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:16.034
Reminding people of all the park
has to offer.

00:01:16.034 --> 00:01:16.743
♪♪

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.412
Marvin, I know there's typos.
I'll fix them.

00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:19.246
Ow, ow.

00:01:19.246 --> 00:01:21.581
Uh, sorry, Owen and I are
sharing an office today.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:22.833
Shampoo in my eyes, ow!

00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:23.959
Our office is the bathroom.

00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:27.004
♪There's always room to grow.♪

00:01:27.004 --> 00:01:29.298
Yeah, dreams are really coming
true today.

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:30.507
Well hopefully not mine.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:33.218
Last night I dreamt a napkin
used me to wipe it's mouth.

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:34.803
Oh, no it's my dream!

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:38.265
♪♪

